        <h2 class="section-heading fade-in">Projects</h2>
        <div class="section-line fade-in"></div>

        <h3 class="projects-subheading fade-in">Current</h3>
        <div class="projects-grid" style="margin-bottom:3.5rem;">

          <!-- Laksh.ai -->
          <article class="project-card fade-in tilt-card" aria-label="Laksh.ai project">
            <div class="card-header">
              <h4 class="card-title">Laksh.ai</h4>
              <span class="status-badge status-active">Active</span>
            </div>
            <p class="card-period">Dec 2025 &ndash; Present</p>
            <div class="stack-tags">
              <span class="stack-tag">Python</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">FastAPI</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">MediaPipe</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">RTMPose</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">YOLOv8</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">ChromaDB</span>
              <span class="stack-tag">Gemini 2.5 Flash</span>
            </div>
            <p class="card-description">Computer vision pipeline for basketball jump-shot analysis using markerless pose estimation and ball tracking. Integrates MediaPipe and RTMPose into a pluggable pose architecture that generates a canonical 12-joint schema for kinematic analysis. Extracts an 8D kinematic fingerprint matched against NBA player profiles via ChromaDB vector search with LLM-generated coaching feedback. Implements injury-risk indicators including knee valgus, landing mechanics, and upper-extremity load derived from pose trajectories.</p>
            <span class="card-metric">~500 NBA players indexed</span>
            <div class="code-block" aria-label="Code snippet: 8D kinematic vector extraction">
              <pre><span class="code-comment"># 8D kinematic vector extraction</span>
<span class="code-var">metrics</span> <span class="code-op">=</span> &#123;
    <span class="code-str">"release_velocity"</span><span class="code-op">:</span> <span class="code-fn">compute_velocity</span><span class="code-punc">(</span>wrist_traj<span class="code-punc">,</span> fps<span class="code-punc">),</span>
    <span class="code-str">"shot_arc_angle"</span><span class="code-op">:</span>   <span class="code-fn">compute_arc</span><span class="code-punc">(</span>elbow<span class="code-punc">,</span> wrist<span class="code-punc">,</span> ball_peak<span class="code-punc">),</span>
    <span class="code-str">"knee_angle"</span><span class="code-op">:</span>       <span class="code-fn">joint_angle</span><span class="code-punc">(</span>hip<span class="code-punc">,</span> knee<span class="code-punc">,</span> ankle<span class="code-punc">),</span>
    <span class="code-str">"elbow_angle"</span><span class="code-op">:</span>      <span class="code-fn">joint_angle</span><span class="code-punc">(</span>shoulder<span class="code-punc">,</span> elbow<span class="code-punc">,</span> wrist<span class="code-punc">),</span>
    <span class="code-str">"kinetic_sync"</span><span class="code-op">:</span>     <span class="code-fn">kinetic_chain_timing</span><span class="code-punc">(</span>hip_t<span class="code-punc">,</span> knee_t<span class="code-punc">,</span> elbow_t<span class="code-punc">),</span>
    <span class="code-str">"fluidity_score"</span><span class="code-op">:</span>   <span class="code-num">1</span> <span class="code-op">-</span> <span class="code-var">np</span><span class="code-op">.</span><span class="code-fn">std</span><span class="code-punc">(</span>angular_velocities<span class="code-punc">),</span>
    <span class="code-str">"hip_rotation"</span><span class="code-op">:</span>     <span class="code-fn">rotation_delta</span><span class="code-punc">(</span>hip_l<span class="code-punc">,</span> hip_r<span class="code-punc">),</span>
    <span class="code-str">"balance_index"</span><span class="code-op">:</span>    <span class="code-fn">center_of_mass_stability</span><span class="code-punc">(</span>keypoints<span class="code-punc">),</span>
&#125;</pre>
            </div>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/parvpatodia/Laksh_AI"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="card-link"
              aria-label="View Laksh.ai on GitHub (opens in new tab)"
            >
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"/></svg>
              View on GitHub
            </a>
